subject":"fix: avoid resolving a config entry as its own parent","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"jostrm/azure-enterprise-scale-ml","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:24:22Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"2fac90b084b329307b630509465aa52a05afe955","github_link":"https://github.com/jostrm/azure-enterprise-scale-ml/commit/2fac90b084b329307b630509465aa52a05afe955","commit_subject":"Install Azure PowerShell modules on ADO agents","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"cardstack/boxel","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:56Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"b4df88e6ff5c220def5188d9a0d95f7cef755b12","github_link":"https://github.com/cardstack/boxel/commit/b4df88e6ff5c220def5188d9a0d95f7cef755b12","commit_subject":"Inject live-search cache; pin cross-user purity; fix CORS + dashboard claims","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"simstudioai/sim","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:54Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"4747afb0e0011e767bc01cb0959ca9576aceed96","github_link":"https://github.com/simstudioai/sim/commit/4747afb0e0011e767bc01cb0959ca9576aceed96","commit_subject":"fix(execution): retry transient database failures during execution setup (#7681)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"AtomGraph/Web-Client","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"0ef9327eb828f1d7ba329967986c043923191089","github_link":"https://github.com/AtomGraph/Web-Client/commit/0ef9327eb828f1d7ba329967986c043923191089","commit_subject":"The shared layer gets a single spelling: common.xsl aggregates everything below the page layout - group-sort, functions, the value/property dispatch, the vocabulary modules in their commented precedence order (sh's modeling-layer fallbacks still first among them), resource, document, container - and internal-layout collapses to the SVG converter plus common plus the layout include, external-layout to the same with imports/external.xsl imported above the whole common layer (its proxy anchor and value-leaf overrides must win over every renderer below, and nothing above common defines the same matches - a deliberate precedence raise from its old mid-list seat, with no overlapping definitions to raise over). Import order IS the precedence ladder (XSLT 3.0 §3.10.3), so the ladder now exists in one file instead of two parallel enumerations, downstream masters (LinkedDataHub's client.xsl among them) can import one module instead of a hand-picked subset, and a module entering a closure twice - two precedences for one stylesheet, the condition behind Saxon's SXWN9019 - becomes structurally impossible rather than list-discipline. Converters stay standalone by design: never aggregated, imported only by the layout aggregators that use them. Both aggregators compile under Saxon-HE 12.9 with zero duplicate-module warnings and zero static errors.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"datahub-project/datahub","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:47Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"bf20b84e5e61cd89a9a31f23a858cbfba2c47ed1","github_link":"https://github.com/datahub-project/datahub/commit/bf20b84e5e61cd89a9a31f23a858cbfba2c47ed1","commit_subject":"fix(cli): accept four-part quickstart --version tags without confirmation (#19704)","ai_tool":"Cursor"},{"repo_name":"onnxsim/onnxsim","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:23:16Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"65b376f7b677cf5dfc55e564f23e187fe71886eb","github_link":"https://github.com/onnxsim/onnxsim/commit/65b376f7b677cf5dfc55e564f23e187fe71886eb","commit_subject":"Wire the SGD-momentum optimizer choice through apply_qat, end to end (phase 2/2)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"appwrite/appwrite","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:22:38Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"aa9be4068b2a52e64102d8cd37ecf812c034fa54","github_link":"https://github.com/appwrite/appwrite/commit/aa9be4068b2a52e64102d8cd37ecf812c034fa54","commit_subject":"docs: state AutoGravity availability on Cloud and self-hosted","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"PrefectHQ/prefect","commit_timestamp":"2026-09-09T21:22:04Z","b